@startuml
' bt-view-kind: activity
' bt-view-id: content-authority:publication-flow
title Content Authority - Publication Flow
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

' bt-element-id: author
' bt-element-id: module
' bt-element-id: compiler
' bt-element-id: validator
' bt-element-id: world_loader

(*) --> "Content Author\nResponsibility: Define experience facts, locations, objects and dramatic policy\nContract: Schema-conforming module changes\n[[../../../../content/modules/_template/README.md source]]" as author
author -->[authors\ncontract: reviewable YAML change] "Authored Module\nResponsibility: Hold canonical versioned content truth\nContract: module.yaml plus referenced YAML documents\n[[../../../../content/modules/god_of_carnage/module.yaml source]]" as module
note on link
[[../../../../content/modules/god_of_carnage/module.yaml relationship source]]
end note
module -->[is compiled by\ncontract: complete referenced document set] "Backend Module Compiler\nResponsibility: Load, validate and normalize authored documents\nContract: Deterministic module model or diagnostics\n[[../../../../backend/app/content/module_loader.py source]]" as compiler
note on link
[[../../../../backend/app/content/module_loader_documents.py relationship source]]
end note
compiler -->[requests validation\ncontract: normalized module candidate] "Module Validator\nResponsibility: Enforce schemas and cross-document references\nContract: Fail-closed validation findings\n[[../../../../backend/app/content/module_validator.py source]]" as validator
note on link
[[../../../../backend/app/content/module_validator.py relationship source]]
end note
validator -->[releases version\ncontract: validation success only] "World Content Loader\nResponsibility: Materialize published content for live sessions\nContract: Read-only runtime projection\n[[../../../../world-engine/app/content/backend_loader.py source]]" as world_loader
note on link
[[../../../../backend/app/content/module_service.py relationship source]]
end note
world_loader --> (*)


legend bottom
Viewpoint: activity
Concern: Fail-closed path from author change to runtime-readable version
Elements expose responsibility, contract and source anchor.
Edges name the interaction or dependency contract.
endlegend
@enduml
